P 8600 5000
F 0 "RPRE1" H 8600 4840 50  0000 C CNN
F 1 "CER-25W-AX" H 8600 5170 50  0000 C CNN
F 2 "" H 8600 5000 50  0001 C CNN
F 3 "~" H 8600 5000 50  0001 C CNN
F 4 "" H 8600 5000 50  0001 C CNN "LCSC"
	1    8600 5000
	1    0    0    -1  
$EndComp
